<title>HONG KONG: Sino Hotels interim net up 16.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Sino Hotels interim net up 16.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  11.25  vs 9.77 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   3.0    vs 2.73 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			   83.45  vs 71.44</p>
<p>    Turnover		    151.27 vs 132.54</p>
<p>    Company name		Sino Hotels (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 April 9-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  May 19</p>
<p>NOTE - Sino Hotels owns, manages of invests in hotel and related hospitality interests in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings and interim dividend have been adjusted for the one-for-10 bonus issue of shares during the period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
